# Inti photo-run tourist map (v0)
# Schema: line-based, whitespace tokens, '#' comments.
#   map        <id> <display name...>
#   start      <xFraction> <yFraction>
#   checkpoint <xFraction> <yFraction> <name>
#   shot       <checkpointName> golden-angle <deg> tolerance <deg>  # composition target
#   path       <checkpointName> <checkpointName>          # corridor + trail dots
#   exit       <xFraction> <yFraction> <nextMap> [name]   # scene-change when area complete
# Fractions are [0,1] of the play area. Max 9 checkpoints (slot 0 = courier).
# Paths/dots/exits ride the engine scene-geometry channel, so they are NOT
# limited to the 10 object slots. Swap this file (or pass another *.intimap
# path) to retarget any tourist area with no engine recompile.

map machu-picchu Machu Picchu Citadel

start 0.50 0.52

checkpoint 0.18 0.30 intihuatana
checkpoint 0.50 0.20 temple-of-the-sun
checkpoint 0.82 0.30 room-of-three-windows
checkpoint 0.86 0.66 main-gate
checkpoint 0.50 0.78 central-plaza
checkpoint 0.16 0.68 guardhouse-terrace

path intihuatana temple-of-the-sun
path temple-of-the-sun room-of-three-windows
path room-of-three-windows main-gate
path main-gate central-plaza
path central-plaza guardhouse-terrace
path guardhouse-terrace intihuatana
path intihuatana central-plaza

# Composition shots: the golden approach heading (degrees, layout space with
# +x right / +y down) is the postcard angle. Arrive along it for a high
# composition score; arrive from the wrong corridor for a blurry snap. The
# temple-of-the-sun hero shot has the tightest cone.
shot temple-of-the-sun golden-angle -18 tolerance 22
shot room-of-three-windows golden-angle 18 tolerance 30
shot main-gate golden-angle 84 tolerance 32
shot central-plaza golden-angle 162 tolerance 34
shot guardhouse-terrace golden-angle -164 tolerance 34
shot intihuatana golden-angle -87 tolerance 30

# Exit sits on the main-gate checkpoint so the path-constrained courier can
# reach it by running the corridors (it cannot leave the path network).
exit 0.86 0.66 huayna-picchu.intimap huayna-picchu-trail
